INT. CLOCKTOWER - MECHANISM ROOM - NIGHT

Brass gears the size of cartwheels grind overhead. Pendulum weights swing in the dark. A single caged lamp throws shadows across oak beams.

TOMASZ REDDING, 40s, ex-cop, rain-soaked, hunches over a battered radio on a workbench. He twists the dial. Static. A woman's voice breaks through, thin and urgent.

                    DISPATCHER (V.O.)
(over radio)
Redding, are you in position?

                    TOMASZ
Three flights up. It's colder than a morgue.

                    DISPATCHER (V.O.)
(over radio)
Is the package there?

He scans the room. A steel case sits in the shadow beneath the great gear. He crosses and lifts it. Heavier than it looks.

                    TOMASZ
Got it.

                    DISPATCHER (V.O.)
(over radio)
Don't open it.

                    TOMASZ
Wasn't going to.

                    DISPATCHER (V.O.)
(over radio)
Redding. Someone knows you're there.

Tomasz freezes. Slowly sets the case down. Draws a pistol from his coat, thumbs the safety.

The trapdoor in the floor creaks. A hand appears on the rim, then a head. He aims. Does not fire.

LEONIDAS PARK, 30s, climbs up out of the stairwell in a delivery uniform, breathing hard, both hands raised. He is soaked to the skin.

                    LEONIDAS
Don't shoot. I work here.

                    TOMASZ
At midnight?

                    LEONIDAS
Maintenance. Somebody has to oil the gears.

From the dark beyond the pendulum, a woman's laugh.

MIRA VASQUEZ-TANAKA, 30s, in a black raincoat, steps from behind a beam. She holds a small silver gun, steady as a surgeon. She is smiling.

                    MIRA
That's very good, Leo.

Leonidas lowers his hands. Smiles back. He turns to Tomasz.

                    LEONIDAS
Sorry, friend.

                    TOMASZ
(to the radio)
Dispatcher. You hearing this?

Static. Nothing. The radio has been switched off, and somewhere in the shadows, Mira's thumb rests on a small black remote.

The great gear above them shifts and drops one tooth. The whole tower shudders.
